"""Token-local getting/result signal, not a sentence-meaning classifier.

English acquisition/result verbs, get/return, getter names, and `into` are
positive. 得 is strongest; its compounds are weaker. Related 德/徳, dé and
some multilingual get/receive stems also respond. Chinese reach, enter,
return, arise, lose and acquire characters give smaller signals. Everything
else gives zero, omitting small lexical responses and context variation.
