"""Approximate a lexical quality/description response, strongest for -ful.

Use only the current token's decoded spelling. Exposed adjective suffixes
receive their own amplitudes; full descriptive words use four calibrated
response bands. Both pleasant and unpleasant qualities count, so this is not
a sentiment classifier. Some non-English descriptors and grammatical markers,
and the restrictive words 'only' and 'just', receive smaller responses.
Unrecognized tokens predict zero. No syntax or earlier context is inferred.
"""

READS = ()

# Adjectives ending in -ful have a particularly strong response. These few
# groups distinguish degree, rather than treating all such words identically.
FUL_STRONG = set('meaningful thoughtful'.split())
FUL_HIGH = set('useful helpful harmful painful peaceful playful mindful'.split())
FUL_LOW = set('wonderful grateful thankful awful unlawful unsuccessful'.split())
FUL_WEAK = set('handful doubtful youthful dreadful'.split())

