compassionate cruel supportive stylish pointless productive prosperous
cautious ambitious humorous benign cumbersome heartfelt mysterious
unconstitutional passionate generous violent elegant advantageous
memorable meaningless unjust unforgettable formidable notorious destructive
problematic deadly fluffy useless pricey unfair luxurious heroic
'''.split())
DESCRIPTORS = set('''
relevant efficient popular exciting convenient manageable versatile proud
loyal toxic wise crucial attractive sustainable responsive sensitive suitable
affordable stunning remarkable honest desirable prominent intense realistic
busy lonely thorough amazing flexible brave sacred eligible notable
significant safe accurate favorable promising vital hungry awesome innovative
creative appropriate historic difficult considerable vulnerable incredible
fatal capable essential stable transparent selective aggressive substantial
accessible curious fragile illegal innocent enthusiastic timely
delicate iconic messy unstoppable intriguing precious vibrant sexy
anxious ignorant nervous jealous vicious hazardous glorious
knowledgeable reusable viable unacceptable undesirable terrible horrible
'''.split())
DESCRIPTORS_SMALL = set('''
necessary nice excellent cheap challenging comprehensive severe systematic
precise sophisticated noble modest enormous competent widespread offensive
dramatic unexpected acceptable confusing respected defensive inflammatory
unusual fair feasible confident practical extensive educational engaging
willing happy secure intuitive quiet exclusive compatible visible legal
fun pregnant boring detailed mature explicit insane impossible ready calm
familiar complicated valid steady favorite excited cool numerous evil
cooperative massive competitive infectious ethical skilled silent glad
robust eager authentic ripe lucky rude heavy liable soluble
'''.split())

